      "widgets_values": [
        "## Inspect a saved HDR frame\nEnter your existing .ffhdr.zip path, adding [output] for an output file. Set frame (zero-based) and run. No LTX nodes are present.\n\nStage: source \u2192 balance \u2192 film \u2192 finish. Choose one stage per inspection; recipe_json supplies the grades and film.\n\nWith the updated core/frontend and Assets enabled, open the EXR in History or Assets. Older builds show an SDR thumbnail; the EXR is also saved in output/fotufilm-inspections.\n\nThe IMAGE output is linear Rec.2020, full float range. Viewer exposure changes inspection only."
